`o 64 r 4A(4)(e) the sum payable for each address for service` MEANS 100

@ref O 64 r 4A(4) (src:7439-7448)
GIVEN `the number of addresses for service` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`o 64 r 4A(4)(e) the sum payable with the request` MEANS
    `the number of addresses for service` TIMES `o 64 r 4A(4)(e) the sum payable for each address for service`

@ref O 64 r 4A(4) (src:7439-7448)
GIVEN `the request is made by an applicant to the Minister` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the request is in the current version of Part 1 of the Model Form` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the request is accompanied by the document to be served` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the request is accompanied by a summary of the document to be served, in accordance with Part 3 of the Model Form` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the documents mentioned in sub-paragraphs (a) and (b) are in English` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the request is accompanied by a translation of those documents in English` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the request is accompanied by a copy each of the request and of the documents mentioned in sub-paragraphs (a), (b) and (c)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the number of addresses for service` IS A NUMBER
      `the sum that accompanies the request` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`o 64 r 4A(4) the request for service is made and accompanied as the Rule requires` MEANS
    IF    `the request is made by an applicant to the Minister`
      AND `the request is in the current version of Part 1 of the Model Form`
      AND `the request is accompanied by the document to be served`
      AND `the request is accompanied by a summary of the document to be served, in accordance with Part 3 of the Model Form`
      AND (`the documents mentioned in sub-paragraphs (a) and (b) are in English` OR `the request is accompanied by a translation of those documents in English`)
      AND `the request is accompanied by a copy each of the request and of the documents mentioned in sub-paragraphs (a), (b) and (c)`
      AND `the sum that accompanies the request` AT LEAST `o 64 r 4A(4)(e) the sum payable with the request` `the number of addresses for service`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): a bare "must be made ... and be accompanied by"; paragraph (6) says what follows (the Minister informs the applicant)

